{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方發現於大型活動結束後，例如演唱會、萬聖節慶祝活動，有大量車流經不同口岸前往內地，當中部分車輛涉嫌為非法載客取酬的跨境白牌車。</p><p>西九龍總區交通部於今日（28日）派員喬裝乘客打擊跨境白牌車，行動中拘捕一名內地男司機，並扣查涉案七人車。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.355628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:24:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:18:06.644139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.355628+00:00","content_hash":"99f5f45036686c5cbffaf7d227723e5038ee91e2ef9afa2ab7e945e150d63280","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}